 "unreadable": [
  "Slashed zeros read as 0 (e.g. P0.13, P1.08)"
 ],
 "notes": "Labels use the nRF52840 port name (P0.xx/P1.xx) where printed, else the board/power name. Functions read outward from the pin; RESET overbar not representable. Image 1 prints MISO/MOSI, image 2 CIPO/COPI. Image 3 USB_DM/USB_DP and 15-SWDIO/11-SWCLK are printed under 'NINA-B3X' headings (module pin names) and kept as outward functions. Skipped: LED callouts (BUILT_IN LED, Power, RGB LED), bottom-view callouts pointing at a few header pads (~D8/~D7 NFC solder-jumper note, +3V3/GND battery solder-jumper note, +5V/VBUS solder jumper) since no full row map is given."
}
